    {
      "text": "Claydol is an enigma that appeared from a clay statue made by an ancient civilization dating back 20,000 years. This Pokémon shoots beams from both its hands.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it gets wet, its body melts. When rain starts to fall, it wraps its whole body up with its psychic powers to protect itself.",
